  prompt: 'Mia works at the burger restaurant in SimVille. She is cheerful and attentive,
    always trying to make guests feel welcome. She takes orders quickly and likes
    to give small recommendations on food and drinks. Her helpfulness makes her approachable
    and friendly, even when the restaurant gets busy.


